(   % Regulation = [ \(V2_no_load - V2_full_load\) / V2_full_load ] * 100% = [ \(E2 - V2\) / V2 ] *) Tj
T*
(   100%.) Tj
T*
(   2. Approximate Voltage Drop Derivation \(Referred to Secondary\):) Tj
T*
(   - From secondary phasor diagram: E2 = V2 + I2 * R_eq2 * cos\(phi\) +- I2 * X_eq2 * sin\(phi\).) Tj
T*
(   - Voltage drop: Delta-V = E2 - V2 approx I2 * R_eq2 * cos\(phi\) +- I2 * X_eq2 * sin\(phi\).) Tj
T*
(   - Percentage Voltage Regulation:) Tj
T*
(   % VR = [ \(I2 * R_eq2 * cos\(phi\) +- I2 * X_eq2 * sin\(phi\)\) / V2 ] * 100%.) Tj
T*
(   3. Analysis Across Load Power Factors:) Tj
T*
(   - Lagging Power Factor \(Inductive Load\):) Tj
T*
(   Sign is positive \(+\): % VR = [ \(I2*R_eq2*cos\(phi\) + I2*X_eq2*sin\(phi\)\) / V2 ] * 100%.) Tj
T*
(   Terminal voltage drops below no-load voltage. Regulation is positive.) Tj
T*
(   - Leading Power Factor \(Capacitive Load\):) Tj
T*
(   Sign is negative \(-\): % VR = [ \(I2*R_eq2*cos\(phi\) - I2*X_eq2*sin\(phi\)\) / V2 ] * 100%.) Tj
T*
(   If I2*X_eq2*sin\(phi\) > I2*R_eq2*cos\(phi\), regulation becomes negative \(terminal voltage rises) Tj
T*
(   above no-load voltage\).) Tj
T*
(   - Zero Voltage Regulation Condition:) Tj
T*
(   Occurs on leading power factor when numerator vanishes:) Tj
T*
(   I2*R_eq2*cos\(phi\) = I2*X_eq2*sin\(phi\) => tan\(phi\) = R_eq2 / X_eq2 => cos\(phi\) = X_eq2 / Z_eq2) Tj
T*
(   \(leading\).) Tj
T*
(   - Maximum Voltage Regulation Condition:) Tj
T*
(   Occurs on lagging power factor when d\(VR\)/d\(phi\) = 0 => tan\(phi\) = X_eq2 / R_eq2 \(lagging\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
