(   2. Electromagnetic Torque Equation:) Tj
T*
(   - Electric power converted to mechanical form: P_em = Eg * Ia.) Tj
T*
(   - Mechanical power: P_mech = T_e * omega_m = T_e * \(2 * pi * N / 60\).) Tj
T*
(   - Equating electric and mechanical power:) Tj
T*
(   T_e * \(2 * pi * N / 60\) = Eg * Ia = [ \(Phi * Z * N * P\) / \(60 * A\) ] * Ia.) Tj
T*
(   - Solving for electromagnetic torque T_e:) Tj
T*
(   T_e = [ \(P * Z\) / \(2 * pi * A\) ] * Phi * Ia = 0.159 * \(P * Z / A\) * Phi * Ia Newton-meters.) Tj
T*
(   - In short: T_e = k_t * Phi * Ia, where k_t is the machine design constant.) Tj
