(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the Equivalent Circuit and Power Flow Diagram of a 3-Phase Induction Motor, deriving power relations.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Induction Motor Power Flow and Energy Conversion:) Tj
T*
(   1. Power Stages from Stator to Rotor Shaft:) Tj
T*
(   - Electrical Input Power to Stator: P_in = sqrt\(3\) * V_L * I_L * cos\(phi\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stator Copper Loss \(P_scl = 3 * I1^2 * R1\) + Stator Core Loss \(P_core\).) Tj
T*
(   - Air-Gap Power \(P_ag\) transferred magnetically across air-gap to rotor:) Tj
T*
(   P_ag = P_in - \(P_scl + P_core\).) Tj
T*
