T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Potier's Zero Power Factor \(ZPF\) Triangle Method:) Tj
T*
(   1. Objective:) Tj
T*
(   - Separates armature leakage reactance \(Xl\) from armature reaction MMF \(Fa\) to achieve accurate) Tj
T*
(   non-saturating voltage regulation.) Tj
T*
(   2. Required Experimental Characteristics:) Tj
T*
(   \(a\) Open Circuit Characteristic \(OCC\): Plot of terminal voltage Voc vs field current If at) Tj
T*
(   rated speed.) Tj
T*
(   \(b\) Zero Power Factor Full-Load Characteristic \(ZPFC\): Plot of terminal voltage vs field) Tj
T*
(   current when alternator delivers rated current to pure inductive load \(cos phi = 0 lag\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Geometric Construction of Potier Triangle \(Triangle BDF\):) Tj
T*
